Z||000000||Mattyman||12-30-2001||02:23 PM||||Ok, im in blockbuster video with my friend and I see this punk kid that I know (wish I didn't) and he looks at me and said, "is the Fiero out there?", I said no because we went in my frineds Stealth. He has a late 80's Camaro and thinks its the best thing ever.  Its in good shape but its actually his dads, he thinks he owns it.  He's one of those kids that thinks he has the best and fastest car around. Then a few minutes later, he was getting smart and said "Oh I wish I had a Fiero" and I started to get mad.  I said to him oh and I wish I had a license.  Last time I saw the kid he didn't have it because he wasn't 16 yet, but he got it 2 months ago. I just laughed.  Then he pulled the famous saying that all punks say "Wanna race". I just laughed and said "ya let me know when you get your own car" and then kinda ignored him, i didn't want to start anything.  When he left my friend said "I wanna listen to his radio so my ears bleed" he said this because at a car show that punk was talking to us and said his radio is the best and it can make you ears bleed.  What an idiot.  Then my friend started going on about how some of those old Camaros handled like trucks (I have nothing against them, i actually like some of them).  It was funny but still got me mad.  What is up with kids these days, when I was that age I would never say something like that to someone in their 20's.  Where do they get this crap from that their cars are the best and why do you always think of thigs to say after the ordeal is over?  I should of sarcastically said "Yeah your right your Camaro is the best everyone wishes they could have one so they could burn Vettes and Vipers at stoplights."  Well actually I should of just beat the kid down. lol<P>Sorry I just had to vent. These kids need some more respect but I guess they will get whats coming to them sometime.<P>------------------<BR>You gotta stand for Something or your gonna fall for everything.||||reg||8
